    { math: '4 · The no-till turn', note: 'Ploughing oxidises organic matter and destroys fungal networks; no-till and cover cropping keep soil covered, roots alive, biology fed — the conservation-agriculture triad (minimum disturbance, cover, rotation) rebuilds the account (the climate lesson\'s soil-carbon prize).' },
