      "s": "Texture is essentially fixed — you farm the hand you are dealt.",
      "truth": true,
      "why": "The sand/silt/clay proportions are set by the parent material; structure, by contrast, is where management lives."
    },
    {
      "s": "Adding a little sand to clay soil improves its drainage.",
